      "created_at": "2018-04-30T11:53:34Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-04-30T11:53:34Z",
      "body": "We are now running google analytics with anonymized IPs and no cookies, so I think we are in compliance without a need for a dialog. We have short-term (30 days retention) logs of IPs for abuse-detection purposes, but that's it and appears to be permitted as long as it is destroyed in a reasonable amount of time.",
